[I] Qt port of obconf, the Openbox configuration tool

[T] ObConf-Qt is a Qt port of ObConf, the configuration editor for the
[T] Openbox window manager, used to set themes, window behavior, desktops
[T] and margins. It can be used independently of LXQt.

[U] https://github.com/lxqt/obconf-qt

[A] Obconf-qt Authors
